# Combinational equivalence: ivy_to_rtl output for multiwrite.ivy ("gold") against
# the hand-written golden model ("gate"). equiv_induct proves that from any equal
# state both compute the same next memory contents -- i.e. ivy_to_rtl emits enough
# write ports, with the later write correctly prioritized. Run from this directory:
#   ivy_to_rtl multiwrite.ivy
#   yosys multiwrite_equiv.ys
read_rtlil multiwrite.il
rename top gold
read_verilog -sv multiwrite_golden.sv
rename top gate
proc
flatten gold
flatten gate
select gold
connect -set rst 1'b0
select gate
connect -set rst 1'b0
select -clear
memory_map
equiv_make gold gate equiv
hierarchy -top equiv
equiv_induct equiv
equiv_status -assert
